================================================================================
PURPOSE
================================================================================

This repository contains content for Chronalife. It is open source so that the
community can help build it out, deepen the content, and contribute. The goal
is collaborative development of Chronalife content—by the community, for
Chronalife.

================================================================================
DEFINITIONS
================================================================================

"Content" means all material in this repository: text, data, code, assets,
documentation, and any other files.

"Chronalife" means Chronalife (the project, product, and associated services)
and its operators.

"You" means any person or entity exercising rights under this license.

"Contribute" means to submit, add, modify, or suggest changes to the Content,
including via pull requests, issues, forks, or other means.

